Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net duplication\[Dash]annihilation law: when a copy \
meets its co-copy head-on, both disappear and their legs join pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7770a4c7-df50-48d0-9f85-320e592f1f17"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7d19732f-0b73-41ae-900d-208cf2b8d37d"],

